# app: widgets6
# Clipboard (DECISIONS.md D21): a long press on a text field opens Paste / Copy all / Clear. Paste is disabled while the
# clipboard is empty, Copy all and Clear while the field is. Copy, paste into the three-line field, clear.
wait 300
long 270 104            # empty field, empty clipboard: everything disabled
wait 900
shot textfield-menu-empty
tap 270 100             # outside the sheet: closes it
wait 900
type Score 42
wait 600
long 270 104
wait 900
shot textfield-menu
tap 270 812             # Copy all: a toast
wait 600
shot textfield-copied
wait 3000
long 270 215            # the three-line field: Paste is enabled now
wait 900
shot textfield-menu-paste
tap 270 724             # Paste: appended at the caret
wait 900
shot textfield-pasted
long 270 104
wait 900
tap 270 900             # Clear
wait 900
shot textfield-cleared
